&P478975 = CDLI Literary 002338 (Public Announcement Loss of Seal) composite 
#atf: lang sux 
@object composite text 
@surface a 
1. kiszib3 mu sar ur-dun dam-gar3-ra u2-gu ba-an-de2 
#tr.en: The seal (with) the inscription of Ur-dun, the merchant, has gone lost. 
>>Q002338 001 
2. inim pu-uh2-ru-um-ma-ta 
#tr.en: (By) word of the assembly 
>>Q002338 002 
3. nimgir-e sila-sila-a si gu3 ba-ni-in-ra 
#tr.en: the herald in the streets sounded the trumpet. 
>>Q002338 003 
4. lu2 na-me nig2 na-me ugu-na li-bi2-in-tuku 
#tr.en: No one may hold him liable for anything. 
>>Q002338 004 
5. {disz}lu2-{d}suen-na szagina 
#tr.en: Lu-Suen, the general; 
>>Q002338 005 
6. {disz}lugal-me-lam2 ensi2 sanga 
#tr.en: Lugal-melam, the city-ruler; 
>>Q002338 006 
6a. KA-KA-ne-ne? ba-an-me-esz kiszib3-ba-ne-ne in-x-esz 
7. {disz}zu-zu um-mi-a 
#tr.en: Zu-zu, the headmaster; 
>>Q002338 007 
8. {disz}si-du3 dub-sar 
#tr.en: Si-du, the scribe; 
>>Q002338 008 
9. {disz}al-lub agrig 
#tr.en: Ad-lub, the steward; 
>>Q002338 009 
10. {disz}ba-an-sa6-ge-en gala sanga 
#tr.en: Bansage, the lamentation-priest (and) temple administrator; 
>>Q002338 010 
11. mul-li2-a ha-za-nu-um 
#tr.en: Mulli’a, the mayor; 
>>Q002338 011 
12. nimgir lu2-ki-inim-ma-me 
>>Q002338 012 
#tr.en: (and) the herald are the witnesses.
